{"MaqraNumber":210.0,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":24,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞وَيَطُوفُ عَلَيۡهِمۡ غِلۡمَانٞ لَّهُمۡ كَأَنَّهُمۡ لُؤۡلُؤٞ مَّكۡنُونٞ","TajweedText":"۞ وَيَطُوفُ عَلَيْهِمْ غِلْمَا<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>نٌ ل</tajweed>َّهُمْ كَأَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ لُؤْلُ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ؤٌ م</tajweed>َّكْن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نٌ <span class=end>٢٤</span>","End":"٢٤","PageNumber":524,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":458,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":25,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَقۡبَلَ بَعۡضُهُمۡ عَلَىٰ بَعۡضٖ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","TajweedText":"وَأَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>بَلَ بَعْضُهُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ضٍ ي</tajweed>َتَس<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٥</span>","End":"٢٥","PageNumber":524,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":458,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":26,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُوٓاْ إِنَّا كُنَّا قَبۡلُ فِيٓ أَهۡلِنَا مُشۡفِقِينَ","TajweedText":"قَال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا كُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا قَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لُ ف<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَهْلِنَا مُشْفِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٦</span>","End":"٢٦","PageNumber":524,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":458,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":27,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَمَنَّ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيۡنَا وَوَقَىٰنَا عَذَابَ ٱلسَّمُومِ","TajweedText":"فَمَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهُ عَلَيْنَا وَوَقَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَا عَذَابَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>مِ <span class=end>٢٧</span>","End":"٢٧","PageNumber":524,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":458,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":28,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّا كُنَّا مِن قَبۡلُ نَدۡعُوهُۖ إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلۡبَرُّ ٱلرَّحِيمُ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا كُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لُ نَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>عُوهُ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> هُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَرُّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّح<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مُ <span class=end>٢٨</span>","End":"٢٨","PageNumber":524,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":458,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":29,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَذَكِّرۡ فَمَآ أَنتَ بِنِعۡمَتِ رَبِّكَ بِكَاهِنٖ وَلَا مَجۡنُونٍ","TajweedText":"فَذَكِّرْ فَم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ بِنِعْمَتِ رَبِّكَ بِكَاهِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>نٍ و</tajweed>َلَا مَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>ن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٢٩</span>","End":"٢٩","PageNumber":524,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":30,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ يَقُولُونَ شَاعِرٞ نَّتَرَبَّصُ بِهِۦ رَيۡبَ ٱلۡمَنُونِ","TajweedText":"أَمْ يَقُولُونَ شَاعِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ ن</tajweed>َّتَرَبَّصُ بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> رَيْبَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٣٠</span>","End":"٣٠","PageNumber":524,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":31,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قُلۡ تَرَبَّصُواْ فَإِنِّي مَعَكُم مِّنَ ٱلۡمُتَرَبِّصِينَ","TajweedText":"قُلْ تَرَبَّصُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> فَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>ِى مَعَك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُتَرَبِّص<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣١</span>","End":"٣١","PageNumber":524,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":32,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ تَأۡمُرُهُمۡ أَحۡلَٰمُهُم بِهَٰذَآۚ أَمۡ هُمۡ قَوۡمٞ طَاغُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ تَأْمُرُهُمْ أَحْلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مُه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِهَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ‌ۚ</tajweed> أَمْ هُمْ قَوْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>مٌ ط</tajweed>َاغ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٢</span>","End":"٣٢","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ يَقُولُونَ تَقَوَّلَهُۥۚ بَل لَّا يُؤۡمِنُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ يَقُولُونَ تَقَوَّلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed>‌ۚ بَل لَّا يُؤْمِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٣</span>","End":"٣٣","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":34,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلۡيَأۡتُواْ بِحَدِيثٖ مِّثۡلِهِۦٓ إِن كَانُواْ صَٰدِقِينَ","TajweedText":"فَلْيَأْتُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِحَدِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ثٍ م</tajweed>ِّثْلِه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِۦٓ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>َانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> صَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>دِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٤</span>","End":"٣٤","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":35,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ خُلِقُواْ مِنۡ غَيۡرِ شَيۡءٍ أَمۡ هُمُ ٱلۡخَٰلِقُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ خُلِقُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مِنْ غَيْرِ شَىْءٍ أَمْ هُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْخَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٥</span>","End":"٣٥","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":36,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ خَلَقُواْ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضَۚ بَل لَّا يُوقِنُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ خَلَقُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضَ‌ۚ بَل لَّا يُوقِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٦</span>","End":"٣٦","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":37,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ عِندَهُمۡ خَزَآئِنُ رَبِّكَ أَمۡ هُمُ ٱلۡمُصَۜيۡطِرُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ عِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ند</tajweed>َهُمْ خَز<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِنُ رَبِّكَ أَمْ هُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُصَۣيْطِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٧</span>","End":"٣٧","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":38,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ لَهُمۡ سُلَّمٞ يَسۡتَمِعُونَ فِيهِۖ فَلۡيَأۡتِ مُسۡتَمِعُهُم بِسُلۡطَٰنٖ مُّبِينٍ","TajweedText":"أَمْ لَهُمْ سُلَّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٌ ي</tajweed>َسْتَمِعُونَ فِيهِ‌ۖ فَلْيَأْتِ مُسْتَمِعُه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِسُلْطَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>نٍ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٣٨</span>","End":"٣٨","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ لَهُ ٱلۡبَنَٰتُ وَلَكُمُ ٱلۡبَنُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ لَهُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تُ وَلَكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٩</span>","End":"٣٩","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":40,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ تَسۡـَٔلُهُمۡ أَجۡرٗا فَهُم مِّن مَّغۡرَمٖ مُّثۡقَلُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ تَسْــَٔلُهُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>رًا ف</tajweed>َه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>َّغْرَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٍ م</tajweed>ُّثْقَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٠</span>","End":"٤٠","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":41,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ عِندَهُمُ ٱلۡغَيۡبُ فَهُمۡ يَكۡتُبُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ عِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ند</tajweed>َهُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْغَيْبُ فَهُمْ يَكْتُب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤١</span>","End":"٤١","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":42,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ يُرِيدُونَ كَيۡدٗاۖ فَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ هُمُ ٱلۡمَكِيدُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ يُرِيدُونَ كَيْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>دًا‌ۖ ف</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> هُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَكِيد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٢</span>","End":"٤٢","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":43,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ لَهُمۡ إِلَٰهٌ غَيۡرُ ٱللَّهِۚ سُبۡحَٰنَ ٱللَّهِ عَمَّا يُشۡرِكُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ لَهُمْ إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هٌ غَيْرُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ‌ۚ سُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>حَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ عَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا يُشْرِك<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٣</span>","End":"٤٣","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":44,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِن يَرَوۡاْ كِسۡفٗا مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ سَاقِطٗا يَقُولُواْ سَحَابٞ مَّرۡكُومٞ","TajweedText":"وَإ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن ي</tajweed>َرَوْ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> كِسْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>فًا م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ سَاقِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>طًا ي</tajweed>َقُولُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> سَحَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بٌ م</tajweed>َّرْك<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٤٤</span>","End":"٤٤","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":45,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَذَرۡهُمۡ حَتَّىٰ يُلَٰقُواْ يَوۡمَهُمُ ٱلَّذِي فِيهِ يُصۡعَقُونَ","TajweedText":"فَذَرْهُمْ حَتَّىٰ يُلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>قُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> يَوْمَهُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى فِيهِ يُصْعَق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٥</span>","End":"٤٥","PageNumber":525,"JuzNumber":27,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":459,"MaqraNumber":210,"HizbNumber":53,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":52,"SurahIndex":"052","VerseNumber":46,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَوۡمَ لَا يُغۡنِي عَنۡهُمۡ كَيۡدُهُمۡ شَيۡـٔٗا وَلَا هُمۡ يُنصَرُونَ","TajweedText":"يَوْم